From 8191bce07d62c5bbb1cbd79482ed416999dedba7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:36:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drip: calendar-day numbering (Day 8 = next week, Day 30 = end
 of month)

Drip Day N now unlocks N-1 calendar days after the registration day, at
00:00 Cambodia time. Day 1 is still immediate. A day that lands on
Saturday or Sunday unlocks on Monday instead, so nothing new opens on
the weekend.

- getDripUnlockMs: calendar days, weekend -> Monday
- admin: quick-pick buttons for Day 1-30 and updated Khmer hint
- tests: rewrite TEST 8 and TEST 9 for the new rule (28/10 example,
  Day 30 inside the 1-month validity, Firestore Timestamp shapes)
